/Title (A\040Systematic\040Study\040of\040the\040Rough\055Water\040Performance\040of\040Planing\040Boats\056\040Irregular\040Waves\040\055\040Part\0402)
/Author (Gerard\040Fridsma)
/Subject (\072\040A\040systematic\040study\040of\040the\040effects\040of\040deadrise\054\040trim\054\040loading\054\040speed\054\040lengthbeam\040ratio\054\040bow\040section\040shape\040and\040sea\040state\040was\040made\040on\040the\040performance\040of\040a\040series\040of\040prismatic\040planing\040boat\040models\040operating\040in\040irregular\040waves\056\040Measurements\040of\040the\040added\040resistance\054\040heave\040and\040pitch\040motions\054\040and\040impact\040accelerations\040at\040the\040bow\040and\040center\040of\040gravity\040served\040as\040the\040basis\040for\040evaluation\056\040Statistical\040analysis\040of\040the\040results\040enabled\040direct\040comparisons\040between\040the\040independently\040varied\040parameters\073\040and\040show\040in\040a\040quantitative\040way\054\040the\040importance\040of\040these\040parameters\040on\040the\040rough\055water\040performance\040of\040planing\040hulls\056\040A\040design\040procedure\040was\040developed\040which\040predicts\040the\040performance\040of\040any\040given\040hull\056)
